[
  {
    "id": "sincerity-check-8c0cee4e",
    "name": "Sincerity Check",
    "active": false,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-12T13:20:18.666331Z",
    "updatedAt": "2026-09-12T13:20:18.666382Z",
    "nodes": [
      {
        "parameters": {
          "httpMethod": "POST",
          "path": "sincerity-check",
          "responseMode": "responseNode",
          "options": {}
        },
        "id": "03ee938a-b0e2-43c9-b8df-8627a3725a34",
        "name": "Webhook",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
        "typeVersion": 2.1,
        "position": [
          200,
          300
        ]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
          "jsCode": "\nconst body = $input.item.json.body || {};\nconst text = body.apology_text || '';\nconst minWords = body.min_words || 50;\nconst threshold = body.threshold || 70;\nconst letter = body.letter || 'Unknown';\n\nconst wordCount = text.split(/\\s+/).filter(w => w.length > 0).length;\n\nconst prompt = `You are the Sincerity Warden, a whimsical but fair judge in a typing-test game.\nA player just deleted the letter \"${letter}\" by pressing Backspace, and must now\natone by writing a genuine, thoughtful apology of at least ${minWords} words\naddressed directly to that letter.\n\nEvaluate the apology below strictly on:\n1. Genuine tone and effort.\n2. Coherence and relevance to apologizing to the letter \"${letter}\".\n3. Absence of filler, copy-pasted repetition, or nonsense text used purely to\n   hit the word count.\n\nRespond with ONLY a JSON object matching the required schema, no other text.\nA sincerity_score of ${threshold} or above must map to verdict \"pass\"; below it,\n\"fail\". Be encouraging but do not pass apologies that are clearly insincere,\nnonsensical, or padded filler.\n\nApology to evaluate:\n\"\"\"\n${text}\n\"\"\"`;\n\n$input.item.json.wordCount = wordCount;\n$input.item.json.minWords = minWords;\n$input.item.json.prompt = prompt;\nreturn $input.item;\n            "
        },
        "id": "fdeec85c-08e3-4527-8e1f-acfe312cdda1",
        "name": "Prepare & Validate",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
        "typeVersion": 2,
        "position": [
          400,
          300
        ]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "conditions": {
            "options": {
              "caseSensitive": true,
              "leftValue": "",
              "typeValidation": "strict"
            },
            "conditions": [
              {
                "id": "e93f6682-1df8-4c90-b997-512c9c5427d7",
                "leftValue": "={{ $json.wordCount }}",
                "rightValue": "={{ $json.minWords }}",
                "operator": {
                  "type": "number",
                  "operation": "gte"
                }
              }
            ],
            "combinator": "and"
          },
          "options": {}
        },
        "id": "da8c5e51-3605-4bb7-a9c0-f2c9546308f7",
        "name": "Check Word Count",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
        "typeVersion": 3,
        "position": [
          600,
          300
        ]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "respondWith": "json",
          "responseBody": "={\n  \"sincerity_score\": 0,\n  \"verdict\": \"fail\",\n  \"feedback\": \"Your apology was too short. You need at least {{ $json.minWords }} words.\"\n}",
          "options": {}
        },
        "id": "04b60838-46a0-4ad9-8939-9b1e659a46af",
        "name": "Respond Fail (Too Short)",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
        "typeVersion": 1.1,
        "position": [
          800,
          500
        ]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "method": "POST",
          "url": "http://host.docker.internal:11434/api/chat",
          "sendBody": true,
          "specifyBody": "json",
          "jsonBody": "={\n  \"model\": \"llama3.1:8b\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": {{ JSON.stringify($json.prompt) }}\n    }\n  ],\n  \"stream\": false,\n  \"options\": {\n    \"temperature\": 0.2\n  },\n  \"format\": {\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n      \"sincerity_score\": { \"type\": \"integer\", \"minimum\": 0, \"maximum\": 100 },\n      \"verdict\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"pass\", \"fail\"] },\n      \"feedback\": { \"type\": \"string\" }\n    },\n    \"required\": [\"sincerity_score\", \"verdict\", \"feedback\"]\n  }\n}",
          "options": {}
        },
        "id": "3cd6e936-2d0b-431c-8996-25d727ce8716",
        "name": "Ollama HTTP Request",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
        "typeVersion": 4.2,
        "position": [
          800,
          100
        ]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
          "jsCode": "\ntry {\n  const content = JSON.parse($input.item.json.message.content);\n  return {\n    json: {\n      sincerity_score: content.sincerity_score || 0,\n      verdict: content.verdict === 'pass' ? 'pass' : 'fail',\n      feedback: content.feedback || 'No feedback provided.'\n    }\n  };\n} catch (e) {\n  return {\n    json: {\n      sincerity_score: 0,\n      verdict: 'fail',\n      feedback: 'The Sincerity Warden was confused by your apology (internal error).'\n    }\n  };\n}\n            "
        },
        "id": "a488f83b-33cb-401d-be00-e4b3f4e5612f",
        "name": "Parse & Guard",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
        "typeVersion": 2,
        "position": [
          1000,
          100
        ]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
